---
import { propertyRoutes } from '../lib/chapter02Models.mjs';
const entries = Object.entries(propertyRoutes);
---

<figure class="chapter-visual property-router" data-property-router>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创教学模型：从性质问题路由到理论对象与证据</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original teaching model: route a property question to its theoretical object and evidence</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls">
    <label>
      <span>目标问题 | Target question</span>
      <select data-property-select>
        {entries.map(([id, route]) => (
          <option value={id}>{route.labelZh} | {route.labelEn}</option>
        ))}
      </select>
    </label>
  </div>

  <div class="property-router__grid">
    {entries.map(([id, route], index) => (
      <article class:list={['property-router__card', { 'property-router__card--active': index === 0 }]} data-property-card={id}>
        <h3>{route.labelZh}</h3>
        <p lang="en">{route.labelEn}</p>
        <dl>
          <dt>理论对象 | Object</dt>
          <dd>{route.objectZh}<br /><span lang="en">{route.objectEn}</span></dd>
          <dt>方法入口 | Method route</dt>
          <dd>{route.methodZh}<br /><span lang="en">{route.methodEn}</span></dd>
          <dt>证据上限 | Evidence ceiling</dt>
          <dd>{route.boundaryZh}<br /><span lang="en">{route.boundaryEn}</span></dd>
        </dl>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>五类性质问题的概念路由表；选择器只突出当前卡片，所有卡片在无 JavaScript 时仍完整显示。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> a conceptual routing table for five classes of property questions. The selector only highlights one card; all cards remain visible without JavaScript.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>默认突出“平衡结构”；选择“光学谱与激子”后只突出 optical 卡片。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> “equilibrium structure” is highlighted by default; selecting “optical spectra and excitons” highlights only the optical card.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>路由给出最低对象和方法类别，不选择具体软件、参数，也不保证所列方法对任何材料都充分。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the router identifies minimum objects and method classes; it does not choose software or parameters and does not guarantee sufficiency for every material.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-property-router]').forEach((root) => {
    const select = root.querySelector('[data-property-select]');
    const cards = root.querySelectorAll('[data-property-card]');
    if (!(select instanceof HTMLSelectElement)) return;

    const update = () => {
      cards.forEach((card) => {
        if (!(card instanceof HTMLElement)) return;
        const active = card.dataset.propertyCard === select.value;
        card.classList.toggle('property-router__card--active', active);
        card.setAttribute('aria-current', active ? 'true' : 'false');
      });
    };

    select.addEventListener('change', update);
    update();
  });
</script>
